## Authors

- **Ed Phillips** — [@phosphene](https://github.com/phosphene) —
  Phosphene R engineering standards, foundry architecture, DFT axioms,
  STDD framework, MPI Handoff Blueprint, and design principles.
  The standards documents in `docs/standards/` are reproduced from
  the [Phosphene R Artifact Foundry](https://github.com/FlowFeel/r-artifact-foundry).

- **Jan Ritch-Frel** — [@janfrel](https://github.com/janfrel) —
  Author of the monograph under review, data curation,
  biological expertise.

- **Flow Feel** — [@FlowFeel](https://github.com/FlowFeel) —
  AI platform engineer: implementation, testing, CI/CD, package
  development, simulacrum test bed.
